    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to bring No. 53 Academy Square, Navan to the market. This two bedroom apartment is located in the much sought after Academy Square development which is situated off the R147 / Dublin Road and just minutes away from the M3 Motorway. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of entrance hall, living area, kitchen/dining area, two double bedrooms with a master ensuite and main bathroom. The apartment has also provides a balcony which overlooks the Boyne River and includes secure designated underground car parking.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is presented in excellent condition throughout and has been recently upgraded by the current owner including a modern kitchen. Academy Square is a desirable development located within walking distance of Navan Town Centre, as well as amenities including national schools, restaurants, sporting clubs, public transport and Navan Shopping Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two bedroom apartment\r\nMaster ensuite bedroom\r\nDesignated underground parking space.\r\nBalcony overlooking the River Boyne\r\nLocated within walking distance of all local amenities"
